<h3>2026-10-29 — Day slots hold courses, not a meal name</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> A scheduled plate can list appetizer, main, side, and dessert. Todos 2640 and 2641 are no longer named Midday and Supper.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> The clock already has the time. The slot should hold a recipe or a four-course plate, not a generic meal name.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Util/HealthKitchen.pm</code>.</p>
</div>
